{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"柏拉图·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"plato","categoryLabel":"柏拉图","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/21_plato/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<p>柏拉图的影响深远地塑造了整个西方文明。本部分追溯他从古代到当代的延续，并把&quot;影响&quot;拆成三种可区分的形态：<strong>人与制度</strong>（他培育的亚里士多德、延续约九百年的学园）、<strong>思想传统的层累</strong>（新柏拉图主义、与基督教的融合）、<strong>跨领域的当代在场</strong>（数学与科学、今日的课堂与语言）。怀特海称整个西方哲学不过是&quot;对柏拉图的一系列注脚&quot;——本 hub 既论证这句话为何成立，也诚实标出它被滥用与被反驳的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub（影响与遗产）只问一个问题：柏拉图的思想<strong>在他身后如何延续、如何被接收与改写</strong>。它不展开柏拉图学说本身——那属于兄弟 hub：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>：理念论、理想国、学园（学说本体）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>：知识论、灵魂论、辩证法（论证内部）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>：各对话篇的文本（一手材料）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>：理念论的逻辑困难、极权主义指控、总体评价（本 hub 多处链向它做&quot;反面校正&quot;）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 与&quot;争议与评价&quot;hub 是一对：本 hub 侧重影响的<strong>广度与延续</strong>，那一 hub 侧重影响的<strong>问题与代价</strong>。两者交叉引用，避免重复展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>建议先具备前置：读过 <a href=\"../core-contributions/the-theory-of-forms/the-world-of-forms\">理念世界</a> 与 <a href=\"../core-contributions/the-republic/\">理想国</a>，否则&quot;理念如何流溢&quot;&quot;哲学王为何被批判&quot;会缺少抓手。之后按下序阅读本 hub：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"foundation-of-philosophy/a-footnote-to-plato\">对柏拉图的注脚</a> — 总论：为何是奠基。</li>\n<li><a href=\"foundation-of-philosophy/aristotle-and-the-academy\">亚里士多德与学园</a> — 最直接的人与制度载体。</li>\n<li><a href=\"platonism/neoplatonism\">新柏拉图主义</a> — 思想传统的古代再造。</li>\n<li><a href=\"platonism/platonism-and-christianity\">柏拉图主义与基督教</a> — 传统注入中世纪。</li>\n<li><a href=\"enduring-influence/platonism-in-science\">数学与科学中的柏拉图主义</a> — 影响溢出哲学。</li>\n<li><a href=\"enduring-influence/plato-today\">今日的柏拉图</a> — 收束于当代，平衡作结。</li>\n</ol>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundation-of-philosophy","title":"Foundation Of Philosophy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/foundation-of-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-footnote-to-plato","title":"对柏拉图的注脚","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/foundation-of-philosophy/a-footnote-to-plato"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aristotle-and-the-academy","title":"亚里士多德与学园","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/foundation-of-philosophy/aristotle-and-the-academy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"platonism","title":"Platonism","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/platonism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neoplatonism","title":"新柏拉图主义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/platonism/neoplatonism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platonism-and-christianity","title":"柏拉图主义与基督教","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/platonism/platonism-and-christianity"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-influence","title":"Enduring Influence","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/enduring-influence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platonism-in-science","title":"数学与科学中的柏拉图主义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/enduring-influence/platonism-in-science"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plato-today","title":"今日的柏拉图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/influence-and-legacy/enduring-influence/plato-today"}]}]}